X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sidgolds": "https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-16-33-46/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:sidgolds
X-SOURCE:Sid Gold's Request Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260515T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260516T010000
DTSTAMP:20260513T000647
CREATED:20260412T144948Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260412T144948Z
UID:10024041-1778875200-1778893200@sidgolds.com
SUMMARY:Piano Karaoke with Dan Neustadt
DESCRIPTION:How it works:\nTip Dan!\nCheck out his song list!\nMake a request!\n\nDan Neustadt (The Hold Steady\, World/Inferno Friendship Society\, Northern Bells) is a keyboardist\, singer-songwriter\, arranger\, and former musical director (also an attorney!). Like Sid Gold’s co-founder Joe McGinty\, Dan is also an alum of the Manhattan Inn and its white baby grand\, where he played stride-piano covers of indie rock singles. Dan’s also the creator of Off The Record\, a NYC and DC concert series featuring “cover-to-cover” instrumentals of seminal rock albums performed by a rotating cast of touring sidemen. Promoted as “Dan Neustadt Plays Your Favorite Albums By Your Favorite Bands\,” a press listing once quipped\, “No\, he’s not kidding.”  Come sing your favorite songs with Dan!
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-16-33-46/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Washington DC\, 1262 5th St NE\, Washington\, DC\, 48226\, United States
CATEGORIES:Washington DC Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Dan-Neustadt.jpeg
END:VEVENT
