CREATED:20260412T145112Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260412T145112Z
UID:10039732-1778961600-1778979600@sidgolds.com
SUMMARY:Piano Karaoke with Mark Benjamin
DESCRIPTION:How it works:\n\nTip Mark!\nCheck out his song list!\nMake A Request!\n\nMusician/comedian Mark Benjamin is thrilled to be making his New York piano karaoke debut at his favorite venue in the city! In addition to his karaoke residency\, he is the host and headliner of Tiny Pianist\, a new monthly musical comedy show at Sid Gold’s Request Room. Mark has performed musical comedy\, musical improv\, and stand up comedy for the past eight years around the city and has been seen in the New York Comedy Festival\, taxi cab public service announcements\, Strawberry Fields John Lennon memorial\, and the Manhattan Neighborhood Network. Mark is currently working on new original material for a musical comedy album and is excited to be a part of the Sid Gold’s Request Room family!\n\nFollow mark on Instagram @themarkbenjamin
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-7-21-4/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Washington DC\, 1262 5th St NE\, Washington\, DC\, 48226\, United States
CATEGORIES:Washington DC Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Mark-B-2025-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
