DESCRIPTION:Asian Glow is the solo post-emo/shoegaze project of Seoul-base
 d musician Shin Gyungwon (born 2001)\, active since 2020. Known for blendi
 ng fuzzed-out guitars\, bedroom-pop production\, and deep sentimentality\,
  he is a key figure in the "new generation" of South Korean indie rock. He
  also releases music under various aliases like noman's'lave and fronts th
 e band FOG.Asian Glow is the lo-fi noise pop wunderkind continually making
  waves on the internet. Noise and angular texture is a benchmark of his st
 yle\; mixing influences from as far as The Microphones to My Bloody Valent
 ine.
