DESCRIPTION:bluem is an existential indie band that writes songs about nat
 ure\, the beauty of friendship\, and the unrelenting passage of time. we s
 ound like that one rock n roll band you love xoxo \\*\\*\\* Big Fat Monday
  is a Northern Virginia folk-rock band built on a mix of folk\, indie rock
 \, pop\, and original storytelling. The group features Christian Shramek (
 bass)\, Bella Kollar (vocals/keys)\, Jacob Torrisi (guitar/vocals)\, Brody
  Minnick (drums)\, and Daniel Farmer (guitar). Together\, they’re shapin
 g a sound that blends genres and decades into something familiar yet disti
 nctly their own. Their two releases\, “Hurricane Song” and “Virginia
  Sun\,” highlight the band’s local roots and the bright\, easy energy 
 that runs through their music.
