X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Songbyrd Music House": "https://dice.fm/event/l8xa5r-sam-elmore-the-ghosts-9th-jul-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:songbyrd
SUMMARY:Sam Elmore & The Ghosts
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260709T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260709T230000
UID:5af1d69470f2cc3bf1d8123f7edd004e@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Thurdsay July 9th Sam Elmore & The Ghosts w/ This Dog'll Hunt 
 and Alexander Gallows Sam Elmore is a pioneering voice in the realm of New
  Americana whose songwriting ethos is at once timeless and acutely tuned-i
 n to the socio-political mores of the present. A genre-bending troubadour\
 , Elmore's work draws from the rich storytelling traditions of folk music\
 , blended with explosive pop hooks and an expansive wall of sound. \\*\\*\
 \* Alexander Gallows is a singer-songwriter based in Washington\, DC. Play
 ing the licks of Hendrix\, mimicking the riffs of Led Zeppelin\, strumming
  the progressions of Bob Dylan\, and harmonizing to the melodies of Simon 
 & Garfunkel were just some of the ways Gallows built his knowledge as a pl
 ayer and songwriter. Whether performing solo\, with his acoustic duo Gallo
 ws & Curl\, or amped up with the Gallows Group\, Alexander brings a modern
  flair to a retro sound\, highlighting his lyricism and storytelling again
 st intricate guitar playing.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/l8xa5r-sam-elmore-the-ghosts-9th-jul-songbyrd-wa
 shington-dc-tickets
X-SOURCE:Songbyrd
END:VEVENT
