X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Songbyrd Music House": "https://dice.fm/event/bboxrg-pete-hayes-the-contradictions-31st-jul-songbyrd-washington-dc-tickets"}
X-SOURCE-ID:songbyrd
SUMMARY:Pete Hayes & The Contradictions
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260731T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260731T230000
UID:d61718639c6aa98d43736163d0911b71@songbyrddc.com
DESCRIPTION:Pete Hayes is the third version of his name. Some say the thir
 d and final form. As a founding member of The Crystal Casino Band\, he now
  steps into his own light\, carrying the flame of the “2014 tumblr indie
  rock” from his zillennial coming of age into something now deeper\, dar
 ker\, and more cinematic. Rooted in Washington\, DC\, his solo work channe
 ls the deadpan swagger of Lou Reed with the introspection of The National 
 paired with the grandeur of Phil Spector’s wall of sound. Pete Hayes is 
 both a continuation and a rebirth\, finishing what he started\, and starti
 ng it all over again.
LOCATION:Songbyrd\, 540 Penn St NE\, Washington\, DC 20002\, USA
URL:https://dice.fm/event/bboxrg-pete-hayes-the-contradictions-31st-jul-so
 ngbyrd-washington-dc-tickets
